ALBUKHR Testnet U2A Investment Patch Package v2 (Draft)
Status: Prepared for engineering review only. Not deployed. Not applied to GitHub or Supabase. Do not use with real funds.
What this package is for
This is an additive, Testnet-only proposal to enable controlled U2A investment/staking tests for projects with a valid Testnet registry record and active Testnet investment terms. It deliberately keeps investor payments separate from project-liquidity payments.
The feature is disabled by default. It must not be enabled on Mainnet.
Package map
src/testnet-investment-router.js — new Express API router for Testnet terms, Pi U2A approval/completion, incomplete-payment recovery, and settlement through a service-role-only RPC.
src/testnet-investment-client.js — new project-page controller, reusing the existing Testnet payment client's in-memory Pi auth and payment flow.
sql/00_preflight_readonly.sql — read-only preflight checks for the existing Testnet schema, terms, triggers, table counts, and routine privileges.
sql/20261014_testnet_u2a_investment.sql — draft Testnet-only migration; creates a separate investment-payment ledger and settlement RPC, and permits new investment stakes to leave the historical liquidity FK blank while preserving it for existing liquidity-related rows.
patches/server.js.patch — opt-in mount for the new API router.
patches/project.html.patch — adds amount/duration controls, Testnet status message, and loads the new controller.
patches/testnet-liquidity-payment-client.js.patch — adds the investment-payment helper and directs incomplete-payment recovery to the correct route based on metadata.
tests/static-guard-test.js — static assertions over security boundaries in this proposal; it is not a live integration test.
tests/acceptance-test-plan.md — required manual/integration cases.
docs/ROLLBACK.md — non-destructive disable/rollback guidance.
